OL,3,GNEWSAVote against assisted dying 'cruel
OL,4,Aand inhumane'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman living with terminal cancer has
OL,7,Fcalled the decision not to legalise
OL,8,Fassisted dying "unfair, cruel and
OL,9,Finhumane".
OL,11,FNadine Thomas, from Dursley in
OL,12,FGloucestershire, hoped the vote, which
OL,13,Fwent before MPs in Parliament last
OL,14,Fweek, would enable her to choose what
OL,15,Fto do as her bone cancer progresses and
OL,16,Ftreatment stops working.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
