OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAVote against assisted dying 'cruel
OL,4,Aand inhumane'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Terminally Ill Adults (End of Life)
OL,7,FBill would have allowed terminally ill
OL,8,Fpeople in England and Wales to legally
OL,9,Fend their own lives. The bill
OL,10,Fstipulated that any approval would be
OL,11,Fsubject to strict safeguards, but
OL,12,Fopponents argued they were
OL,13,Finsufficient.
OL,15,FMPs voted 286 to 270 against it on
OL,16,FFriday. It now cannot be reconsidered
OL,17,Funtil at least the next parliament.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
